write_page('/services/','Home services in Delco, Chester County and the Main Line','Explore local heating, cooling, Boiler, Water Heater, plumbing and electrical services with Wazoozie.',inner('Home services','What needs<br>a little attention?','A repair, a replacement, or a project you’re still thinking through. Get to know the service and the business behind it.',service_list+'<h2>Choose who you contact.</h2><p>Boiler, heating, cooling, and Water Heater inquiries route to Middletown HVAC. General plumbing inquiries connect to the Liberator listing; electrical inquiries connect to the Ryan Dugan listing. Each business confirms coverage and availability directly.</p>'))
