region_body+='<h2>Regional reach. Address-level answers.</h2><p>Wazoozie is being built for the broader Delco, Chester County and the Main Line. The current directory contains four business listings. Regional content is not a statement that every business serves every county or state.</p><p>For an appointment, tell the business your address, equipment or project type, and timing. Confirm service availability before using an online booking option.</p>'
write_page('/delaware-valley/','Local home services across Delco, Chester County and the Main Line','Explore Wazoozie’s Delco, Chester County and the Main Line plans for Pennsylvania, South Jersey and northern Delaware. Confirm each provider’s coverage for your address.',inner('Delco, Chester County and the Main Line','Local neighborhoods.<br>People you can reach.','Philadelphia and its surrounding communities, South Jersey, and northern Delaware. A region built from places that feel like home.',region_body,eyebrow='THE PLACES WE CALL HOME'))
write_page('/about/','About Wazoozie','Wazoozie introduces Delco, Chester County and the Main Line homeowners to local service businesses. Explore local services and make contact directly.',inner('About Wazoozie','Your home deserves<br>good people.','A local introduction should feel clear, personal, and entirely your choice.','<h2>Meet the business first.</h2><p>Wazoozie helps Delco, Chester County and the Main Line homeowners explore local home-service businesses and decide who to contact. Read the profile, ask about your address, and arrange the work directly with the business.</p><h2>Built around your choice.</h2><p>Wazoozie helps homeowners discover named businesses and make direct contact. A recommendation is a starting point, not a guarantee of a particular project’s outcome.</p><h2>A growing directory.</h2><p>The initial directory includes Middletown HVAC, Ryan Dugan Electric LLC, Liberator Service Company, and Cooke Carpentry & Construction, LLC. Each business has been vetted by Wazoozie. Profiles include direct contact details and sourced excerpts from published customer reviews.</p><h2>Built for our area.</h2><p>Our regional plans span Pennsylvania, New Jersey, and Delaware. Each business sets its own service area. New Jersey and Delaware provider coverage is being developed.</p>'))
write_page('/privacy/','Privacy','How Wazoozie handles website requests, email drafts and direct provider links.',inner('Privacy','Your information.<br>Your choice.','A clear introduction starts with a clear explanation.','<h2>Browsing and direct contact.</h2><p>You can browse without entering contact details. Calls, business website links, and booking links connect you directly with the named business or its booking provider. Those services have their own privacy practices.</p><h2>Email request forms.</h2><p>The forms prepare an email draft in your own email application. Entries are held in the open page and are not automatically sent to Wazoozie or saved in a Wazoozie leads database. You must review and send the email yourself. The named recipient and your email provider receive the information when you choose to send.</p><h2>Referral links.</h2><p>Business website and booking links may identify Wazoozie as the referral source. They do not include the information you type into the request form.</p><h2>Technical services.</h2><p>The website host may process request information such as IP addresses and access logs. Fonts load from Google Fonts. This version includes no advertising pixels, marketing cookies, or automatic marketing texts.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>You can reach the operator through <a href="mailto:service@mtownhvac.com?subject=Wazoozie%20privacy%20question">service@mtownhvac.com</a>. This notice describes the current static site; it must be updated when lead storage or delivery changes.</p>'))
write_page('/how-it-works/','How Wazoozie works','Learn about Wazoozie directory listings, homeowner choice, ownership and service requests.',inner('How this service works','Your home.<br>Your call.','Explore the businesses. Choose who to contact. Agree on the work directly.','<h2>A directory and an introduction.</h2><p>Wazoozie does not perform, supervise, or guarantee work arranged through this directory. The listed businesses have been vetted by Wazoozie. Each business confirms its availability and project terms.</p><h2>Direct agreements.</h2><p>The homeowner and business agree directly on scope, price, payment, scheduling, permits, and warranty terms. Contacting a business is not a confirmed appointment or an accepted estimate.</p><h2>About the listings.</h2><p>Wazoozie lists Middletown HVAC, Ryan Dugan Electric LLC, Liberator Service Company and Cooke Carpentry & Construction, LLC. Each has been vetted by Wazoozie. Middletown HVAC appears first in the directory. Listing order is an editorial choice, not a ranking of quality. Published review excerpts link to their sources.</p><h2>Requests and urgent service.</h2><p>Email forms prepare drafts; they do not automatically deliver requests. Direct booking opens the provider’s booking service. Call the business to ask about urgent availability. Wazoozie is not an emergency response service.</p><h2>Growing coverage.</h2><p>Wazoozie’s plans cover Delco, Chester County and the Main Line. Every business confirms availability for your address. New Jersey and Delaware provider coverage is not yet confirmed.</p>'))
write_page('/404/','Page not found','Find your way back to local home services on Wazoozie.', '<div class="wrap"><section class="page-hero"><div><div class="eyebrow">A SMALL DETOUR</div><h1>Let’s get you<br>back home.</h1><p class="lede">That page isn’t here. Your next local connection might be.</p><a class="btn primary" href="/">Back to Wazoozie →</a></div></section></div>')
