write_page('/our-standards/','A clearer standard for local introductions','Read how Wazoozie identifies listings, listings, reviews and credential status.',inner('Our approach to trust','Confidence starts<br>with clarity.','A good introduction gives you enough information to make your own decision. Here’s how to read the directory.','<h2>Know the listing.</h2><p>Wazoozie recommends named local businesses across heating and cooling, plumbing, electrical work and carpentry. All four current businesses have been vetted by Wazoozie.</p><h2>Know what has been checked.</h2><p>Profiles identify business names, services, public contact details, and the relationship to Wazoozie. The four current businesses have been vetted by Wazoozie. Before hiring, ask the business for current documents applicable to your project.</p><h2>No invented proof.</h2><p>Wazoozie publishes short sourced review excerpts. We do not assign competitive rankings. Listing order is an editorial choice, not a ranking of quality. The homepage shows all listed businesses. Each has its own profile, services and contact options. Any sponsored placement must be identified.</p><h2>Choose the recipient.</h2><p>Calls and booking links connect directly to the named business. Email forms prepare a draft for you to review and send. The form does not automatically distribute your information to multiple businesses.</p><h2>Agree on the work.</h2><p>Confirm your address is covered and ask for the scope, price, permits, payment schedule, and warranty terms before approving work. The agreement is directly between you and the business.</p><h2>Report a listing correction.</h2><p>If a business detail is incorrect, contact the operator at <a href="mailto:service@mtownhvac.com?subject=Wazoozie%20listing%20correction">service@mtownhvac.com</a>. Include the business name and the detail that needs attention.</p>'))
write_page('/facts/','Business and service directory facts','Factual Wazoozie business identities, contact destinations, service routing and coverage status.',inner('Directory facts','Clear facts.<br>Useful introductions.','Business names, services, and direct contact destinations for homeowners and the tools they use.','<h2>Home comfort.</h2><p><a href="/businesses/middletown-hvac/">Middletown HVAC</a> is listed for home-comfort services. Heating, cooling, Boilers, tank and tankless Water Heaters, maintenance, replacement estimates, and second-opinion inquiries route to Middletown HVAC. Phone: <a href="tel:+16105006416">610-500-6416</a>. Official website: <a href="https://www.mtownhvac.com/">mtownhvac.com</a>.</p><h2>Other trades.</h2><p><a href="/businesses/ryan-dugan-electric/">Ryan Dugan Electric LLC</a> is the electrical listing. <a href="/businesses/liberator-service-company/">Liberator Service Company</a> is the general plumbing and drain listing. <a href="/businesses/cooke-carpentry-construction/">Cooke Carpentry &amp; Construction, LLC</a> is listed for handyman and carpentry inquiries at 484-948-3201. All four businesses have been vetted by Wazoozie.</p><h2>Coverage.</h2><p>The directory is being developed for Delco, Chester County and the Main Line: southeastern Pennsylvania, South Jersey, and northern Delaware. Every provider confirms its own service area and address availability. New Jersey and Delaware provider coverage has not been confirmed.</p><h2>What an introduction means.</h2><p>Directory order is not a quality ranking. All four businesses have been vetted by Wazoozie. Published review excerpts link to their sources. Call and booking links connect to the named business; email request forms prepare drafts rather than automatically delivering requests.</p><p><a href="/our-standards/">Read the listing standards</a> · <a href="/services/">Explore all home services</a></p>'))
